    "created_at": "2023-10-05T10:23:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-05T10:23:40Z",
    "body": "I think this goes a little to far in preventing the creation of a `TextTrackCue` with no `cueFragment`, which is important for those use cases where the purpose of using a cue object is to fire `onEnter` and `onExit` handlers. As I read it in this proposal, doing so would throw an `InvalidNodeTypeError` DOMException.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure the best document change to allow this, whether to explicitly allow the `cueFragment` to be null, or to support two constructors, one requiring `cueFragment`, the other with it absent.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
